  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CM01129",
    "sub_id": "43200",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "(1)期中考(Midterm Examination): 20%\n(2)報告(Report): 30%\n(3)小組報告(Team Project): 15%\n(4)課堂參與和出席 (Class Participation & Attendance): 35%",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "所有課程活動都將在同學之間的友好參與和互動氛圍中進行，彼此間尊重和欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點，如國內外各學制、多元入學及學習文化、性別等。希望您始終在本課程中應用最高的學術標準，並以有尊嚴和尊重的態度對待同學。",
    "course_pol_en": "All course activities will be carried out in an atmosphere of friendly participation and interaction among students, respecting and appreciating each student's personal experience, background and perspectives, such as various school systems at home and abroad, diverse enrollment and learning cultures, gender, etc. You are expected to apply the highest academic standards throughout this course and to treat fellow students with dignity and respect.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": "Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Statement I design my instruction so that students from different backgrounds and perspectives can learn well from the course, that the learning needs of the students are addressed, and that the diversity that students bring to the course can be met with a raise of hand, invitation You are appropriately expressed and seen as a resource, strength and benefit to all students. If you have any concerns, please take advantage of the time to come to me.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Learning must be based on honesty. Any student who attempts to use a work that he has not produced as his own is considered dishonest. Students who cheat or plagiarize in homework, tests or exams, or assist others, will be scored as zero. If they are repeat offenders, they will be submitted in accordance with the rewards and punishments for students of Feng Chia University.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
